    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Fills the provided <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> with the necessary <a href=\"DbAction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction</code></a>s to delete the aggregate root\nidentified by <code>id</code>. If <code>id</code> is <code>null</code> it is interpreted as \"Delete all aggregates of the type\nindicated by the aggregateChange\".",
      "translation": "使用必要的<a href=\"DbAction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction</code></a>填充提供的<a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a>，以删除由<code>id</code>标识的聚合根。如果<code>id</code>为<code>null</code>，则将其解释为“删除由 aggregateChange 指示类型的所有聚合”。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Converts an entity that is about to be deleted into <a href=\"DbAction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction</code></a>s inside a <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> that\nneed to be executed against the database to recreate the appropriate state in the database. If the\n<a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> has a reference to the entity and the entity has a version attribute, the delete will\ninclude an optimistic record locking check.",
      "translation": "将即将被删除的实体转换为 <a href=\"DbAction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction</code></a>，并将其放入 <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> 中，以便在数据库中执行这些操作以重建相应的数据库状态。如果 <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> 包含对该实体的引用且该实体具有版本属性，则删除操作将包括乐观记录锁定检查。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Fills the provided <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a> with the necessary <a href=\"DbAction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>DbAction</code></a>s to delete the aggregate root\nidentified by <code>id</code>.",
      "translation": "将提供的<a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion 中的接口\"><code>MutableAggregateChange</code></a>填充有删除由<code>id</code>标识的聚合根所需的<a href=\"DbAction.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion 中的接口\"><code>DbAction</code></a>s。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityWriter.html#write(T,S)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">write</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityWriter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">EntityWriter</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>, <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\">MutableAggregateChange</a>&lt;?&gt;&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityWriter.html#write(T,S)\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.data.convert 中的\">write</a></code> 在接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityWriter.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.data.convert 中的\">EntityWriter</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.lang 中的\">Object</a>, <a href=\"MutableAggregateChange.html\" title=\"接口 org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion 中的\">MutableAggregateChange</a>&lt;?&gt;&gt;</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
